w-gardens/\" class=\"psDb ps-no-td\">                                       \n                \n                <h4 class=\"ps-h-mobile-3 psMb-0 ps-rel psPr-7\">\n                    <span>Dirty Dancing</span>\n                                            <span class=\"ps-abs ps-abs-b0 psMeta psMl-2\">(12)</span>\n                                    </h4>  \n                                                  \n                                    <span class=\"ps-h ps-h-5\">Friday, June 19</span>\n                \n            </a>\n        \n            <div class=\"psMt-3 psMb-3\">\n\n                <span class=\"psDb\">\n\n                    Gates 18:00\n                </span> \n\n            </div>\n\n                            <p>Step back into the summer of Dirty Dancing and enjoy an iconic love story filled with music, dance and movie magic under the stars.</p>\n                            \n            <div class=\"psFlex psGap-2 psMt-4\">\n\n                <a class=\"psButton psButton--primary psFlex--noShrink\" href=https://adventurecinema.co.uk/event/dirty-dancing-at-kew-gardens/>   \n                    <span class=\"psButton__bg\"></span>\n                    <span class=\"psButton__labelWrapper\">\n                        <span class=\"psButton__label\">More Info</span>\n                        <span class=\"psButton__labelHover\">More Info</span>\n                    </span>\n                </a>\n\n                \n                    <span class=\"psButton psButton--disabled psFullWidth\">\n                        Sold Out\n                    </span>\n\n                \n            </div>   \n\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n</div>\n\n                                                    \n                    \n<div data-block-slide class=\"blockSlider__slide psMr-5 ps-rel\">                      \n\n    <div class=\"blockLinks__card psBr psBor--dark ps-oh psDb ps-no-td\">\n\n        \n            <a href=\"https://adventurecinema.co.uk/event/en