y, June 18</span>\n                \n            </a>\n        \n            <div class=\"psMt-3 psMb-3\">\n\n                <span class=\"psDb\">\n\n                    Gates 18:00\n                </span> \n\n            </div>\n\n                            <p>Experience the magic of Wicked: For Good on the big screen under the stars.</p>\n                            \n            <div class=\"psFlex psGap-2 psMt-4\">\n\n                <a class=\"psButton psButton--primary psFlex--noShrink\" href=https://adventurecinema.co.uk/event/wicked-for-good-at-kew-gardens/>   \n                    <span class=\"psButton__bg\"></span>\n                    <span class=\"psButton__labelWrapper\">\n                        <span class=\"psButton__label\">More Info</span>\n                        <span class=\"psButton__labelHover\">More Info</span>\n                    </span>\n                </a>\n\n                \n                    \n                        <button class=\"psButton psButton--secondary psFullWidth\" \n                                data-eb-widget-trigger\n                                data-eb-event-id=\"1983458669273\"                        >   \n                            <span class=\"psButton__bg\"></span>\n                            <span class=\"psButton__labelWrapper\">\n                                <span class=\"psButton__label\">Get Tickets</span>\n                                <span class=\"psButton__labelHover\">Get Tickets</span>\n                            </span>\n                        </button>\n\n                    \n                \n            </div>   \n\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n</div>\n\n                                                    \n                    \n<div data-block-slide class=\"blockSlider__slide psMr-5 ps-rel\">                      \n\n    <div class=\"blockLinks__card psBr psBor--dark ps-oh psDb ps-no-td\">\n\n        \n            <a href=\"https://adventurecinema.co.uk/event/dirty-dancing-at-kew-gardens/\" class=\"blockLinks__mediaWrap psDb\">\n\n                \n    <div class=\"psLazyLoadFrame\" style=\"\n                --focal-x: 50%;\n        --focal-y: 50%;\n        --focal-x-small: 50%;\n        --focal-y-small: 50%;\n        \"> \n        <div class=\"opacityWrap\" style=\"opacity: 1\">\n                            <picture>\n                    \n                        <source \n                            srcset=\"https://adventurecinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Dirty-Dancing-site-pic-2-760x456.jpg\" \n                            media=\"(max-width: 1023px)\">\n                        \n                        <source \n                            srcset=\"https://adventurecinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Dirty-Dancing-site-pic-2.jpg\" \n                            media=\"(min-width: 1024px)\">\n\n                                        <img \n                        src=\"data:image/svg+xml&#44;%3Csvg xmlns='https://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 1200 720'%3E%3C/svg%3E\"\n                        alt=\"\"\n                        class=\"JS--lazyLoad psFitCover blockLinks__media\"\n                                                loading=\"lazy\"\n                    />\n                </picture>\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n\n      \n\n                \n                    <div class=\"psLabelWrap ps-abs\">\n                        \n\n    <span class=\"psLabel psLabel--alert\" data-alert-label>  \n        <svg class=\"psFill--none psHgt-1e\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\">\n                    <path class=\"psFill--dark\" d=\"M5.14614 1.51576C5.14614 1.51576 6.31703 -0.606754 7.76708 0.171535C9.22306 0.953101 8.83485 2.17215 7.76708 2.95371C7.76708 2.95371 9.96741 2.64109 9.99964 4.92319C10.032 7.2053 7.89648 7.01769 7.89648 7.01769C7.89648 7.01769 9.38553 8.53085 8.09067 9.51854C6.8611 10.4564 5.53452 9.61226 5.08153 8.36192C5.08153 8.36192 3.98136 10.8315 1.84581 9.70615C-0.174419 8.64161 1.81342 6.54875 1.81342 6.5