sPr-7\">\n                    <span>Pride and Prejudice</span>\n                                            <span class=\"ps-abs ps-abs-b0 psMeta psMl-2\">(U)</span>\n                                    </h4>  \n                                                  \n                                    <span class=\"ps-h ps-h-5\">Sunday, June 21</span>\n                \n            </a>\n        \n            <div class=\"psMt-3 psMb-3\">\n\n                <span class=\"psDb\">\n\n                    Gates 13:30\n                </span> \n\n            </div>\n\n                            <p>Fall in love all over again with the timeless romance of Pride & Prejudice on an open-air screen, set against a stunning backdrop.</p>\n                            \n            <div class=\"psFlex psGap-2 psMt-4\">\n\n                <a class=\"psButton psButton--primary psFlex--noShrink\" href=https://adventurecinema.co.uk/event/pride-and-prejudice-at-kew-gardens/>   \n                    <span class=\"psButton__bg\"></span>\n                    <span class=\"psButton__labelWrapper\">\n                        <span class=\"psButton__label\">More Info</span>\n                        <span class=\"psButton__labelHover\">More Info</span>\n                    </span>\n                </a>\n\n                \n                    <span class=\"psButton psButton--disabled psFullWidth\">\n                        Sold Out\n                    </span>\n\n                \n            </div>   \n\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n</div>\n\n                                                    \n                    \n<div data-block-slide class=\"blockSlider__slide psMr-5 ps-rel\">                      \n\n    <div class=\"blockLinks__card psBr psBor--dark ps-oh psDb ps-no-td\">\n\n        \n            <a href=\"https://adventurecinema.co.uk/event/jurassic-park-at-kew-gardens/\" class=\"blockLinks__mediaWrap psDb\">\n\n                \n    <div class=\"psLazyLoadFrame\" style=\"\n                --focal-x: 50%;\n        --focal-y: 50%;\n        --focal-x-small: 50%;\n        --focal-y-small: 50%;\n        \"> \n        <div class=\"opacityWrap\" style=\"opacity: 1\">\n                            <picture>\n                    \n                        <source \n                            srcset=\"https://adventurecinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Jurassic-Park-feature-image-760x456.png\" \n                            media=\"(max-width: 1023px)\">\n                        \n                        <source \n                            srcset=\"https://adventurecinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Jurassic-Park-feature-image.png\" \n                            media=\"(min-width: 1024px)\">\n\n                                        <img \n                        src=\"data:image/svg+xml&#44;%3Csvg xmlns='https://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 1100 660'%3E%3C/svg%3E\"\n                        alt=\"\"\n                        class=\"JS--lazyLoad psFitCover blockLinks__media\"\n                                                loading=\"lazy\"\n                    />\n                </picture>\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n\n      \n\n                \n                    <div class=\"psLabelWrap ps-abs\">\n                        \n\n    <span class=\"psLabel psLabel--alert\" data-alert-label>  \n        <svg class=\"psFill--none psHgt-1e\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\">\n                    <path class=\"psFill--dark\" d=\"M5.14614 1.51576C5.14614 1.51576 6.31703 -0.606754 7.76708 0.171535C9.22306 0.953101 8.83485 2.17215 7.76708 2.95371C7.76708 2.95371 9.96741 2.64109 9.99964 4.92319C10.032 7.2053 7.89648 7.01769 7.89648 7.01769C7.89648 7.01769 9.38553 8.53085 8.09067 9.51854C6.8611 10.4564 5.53452 9.61226 5.08153 8.36192C5.08153 8.36192 3.98136 10.8315 1.84581 9.70615C-0.174419 8.64161 1.81342 6.54875 1.81342 6.54875C1.81342 6.54875 -0.289742 6.73636 0.0338472 4.82947C0.357436 2.92258 2.49299 3.70415 2.49299 3.70415C2.49299 3.70415 0.551623 2.016 2.68717 0.796952C4.29732 -0.122249 5.14631 1.51593 5.14631 1.51593L5.14614 1.51576Z\" />\n                </svg>        SOLD OUT!        <svg class=\"psFill--none psHgt-1e\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\">\n                    <path class=\"psFill--dark\" d=\"M5.14614 1.51576C5.14614 1.51576 6.31703 -0.606754 7.76708 0.171535C9.22306 0.953101 8.83485 2.17215 7.76708 2.95371C7.76708 2.95371 9.96741 2.64109 9.99964 4.92319C10.032 7.2053 7.89648 7.01769 7.89648 7.01769C7.89648 7.01769 9.38553 8.53085 8.09067 9.51854C6.8611 10.4564 5.53452 9.61226 5.08153 8.36192C5.08153 8.36192 3.98136 10.8315 1.84581 9.70615C-0.174419 8.64161 1.81342 6.54875 1.81342 6.54875C1.81342 6.54875 -0.289742 6.73636 0.0338472 4.82947C0.357436 2.92258 2.49299 3.70415 2.49299 3.70415C2.49299 3.70415 0.551623 2.016 2.68717 0.796952C4.29732 -0.122249 5.14631 1.51593 5.14631 1.51593L5.14614 1.51576Z\" />\n                </svg>    </span>\n    \n                    </div>\n\n                \n            </a>\n\n        \n        <div class=\"blockLinks__content psPd-base psBg--light psColor--dark\">\n            \n            <a href=\"https://adventurecinema.co.uk/event/jurassic-park-at-kew-gardens/\" class=\"psDb ps-no-td\">                                       \n                \n                <h4 class=\"ps-h-mobile-3 psMb-0 ps-rel psPr-7\">\n                    <span>Jurassic Park</span>\n                                            <span class=\"ps-abs ps-abs-b0 psMeta psMl-2\">(PG)</span>\n                                    </h4>  \n                                                  \n                                    <span class=\"ps-h ps-h-5\">Sunday, June 21</span>\n                \n            </a>\n        \n            <div class=\"psMt-3 psMb-3\">\n\n                <span class=\"psDb\">\n\n                    Gates 18:00\n                </span> \n\n            </div>\n\n                            <p>Relive the epic adventure of Jurassic Park like never before on a huge open-air screen under the stars!</p>\n                            \n            <div class=\"psFlex psGap-2 psMt-4\">\n\n                <a class=\"psButton psButton--primary psFlex--noShrink\" href=https://adventurecinema.co.uk/event/jurassic-park-at-kew-gardens/>   \n                    <span class=\"psButton__bg\"></span>\n                    <span class=\"psButton__labelWrapper\">\n                        <span class=\"psButton__label\">More Info</span>\n                        <span class=\"psButton__labelHover\">More Info</span>\n                    </span>\n                </a>\n\n                \n                    <span class=\"psButton psButton--disabled psFullWidth\">\n                        Sold Out\n                    </span>\n\n                \n            </div>   \n\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n</div>\n\n                \n            </div>            \n\n        </div>\n\n    </section>\n\n    \n    \n                    \n    <section class=\"flexiLayout flexiLayout--nt flexiLayout--nb freeText psTheme--transparent\">\n\n        <div class=\"maxWidth\">\n\n            <div class=\"freeText__inner psFlex--largeUp ps-rel ps-z-1\">\n                    \n                <div class=\"psMb-6\">\n                    <h3>Everything you need to know about screenings at Kew Gardens</h3>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"freeText__contentCol ps-h ps-h-6 psMb-0 psDefaultContent\">\n                    <p>Screenings take place on the lawn, near the Pavilion Bar and Grill. Please follow directional signage and steward’s directions. See the event location on <a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/AvnyWyaJNGccsY2Y8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google Maps here</a>.</p>\n<p><strong>We recommend entering via <a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/DpgDVVB6Fv6LmZgy5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Lion Gate</a> on Kew Road (TW9 2DF), opposite Lion Gate Gardens, for the easiest access.</strong></p>\n<p>For evening screenings, entrance must be via <a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/DpgDVVB6Fv6LmZgy5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Lion Gate</a>, and the exit will be through <a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/gGb2XwTzAfunb4n7A\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Pavilion Gate</a> onto Kew Road (all other gates will be closed).</p>\n<p>You can only access the event location at the time of your screening, please check the gates opening time listed on your chosen show.</p>\n<p>We strongly recommend using public transport, taxi or travelling on foot where possible.</p>\n<p>There is no designated event car park available, guests can make use of nearby public car parks and pay and display options.</p>\n<p>Please note that Kew Gardens&#8217; car park near Brentford Gate will be closed during the evening screenings.</p>\n<p><em><strong>No access is permitted before the gates opening time listed on your chosen show.</strong></em></p>\n                </div>  \n\n            </div>\n            \n        </div>\n        \n    </section>\n\n    \n            \n     \n    \n    \n        \n        <section \n            data-flexi-layout         \n            class=\"flexiLayout flexiLayout--nt flexiLayout--nb map psTheme--transparent\"\n        >\n\n            <div class=\"maxWidth\">\n\n                <div class=\"map__inner ps-rel ps-z-5\">  \n                                        \n                    <div class=\"map__mapCol psBr--large psBor--dark ps-oh ps-rel\">\n                            \n                        <iframe \n                            width=\"100%\" \n                            height=\"100%\" \n                            class=\"map__embed\"\n                            frameborder=\"0\" \n                            style=\"border:0\"\n                            src=\"https://maps.google.com/maps?q=51.472352156498,-0.2947935461998&z=14&output=embed&t=k\" \n                            allowfullscreen \n                            loading=\"lazy\"\n                        ></iframe>                        \n                        \n                    </div>    \n                    \n                    <div class=\"map__textCol ps-oh psBr--large psBor--dark psBg--light psColor--dark psPd-6\">\n\n                        <div class=\"map__textWrap\">\n\n                            <span class=\"psTag psTag--yellow psMb-3\">Getting Here</span>\n\n                            <h3 class=\"ps-h-2 psMb-0\">\n                                Where is Kew Gardens?\n                            </h3>                                      \n                                  \n                            <span class=\"ps-h ps-h-5 psMb-0 psDb psMt-5\">\n                                <p>Richmond<br />\nLondon<br />\nTW9 2DF</p>\n                            </span> \n                            \n                            <a class=\"psMt-5 psButton psButton--secondary\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=51.472352156498,-0.2947935461998\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n                                <span class=\"psButton__bg\"></span>\n                                <span class=\"psButton__labelWrapper\">\n                                    <span class=\"psButton__label\">Get Directions</span>\n                                    <span class=\"psButton__labelHover\">Get Directions</span>\n                                </span>\n                            </a>\n\n                        </div>                \n\n                    </div>                                       \n\n                </div>    \n\n            </div>    \n\n        </section>\n\n    \n\n            \n    \n    <section \n        data-flexi-layout \n                class=\"flexiLayout flexiLayout--nt flexiLayout--nb fiftyFifty psTheme--transparent\"\n    >\n\n        <div class=\"maxWidth\">\n\n            <div class=\"fiftyFifty__inner fiftyFifty__inner--reversed\">  \n                \n                <div class=\"fiftyFifty__mediaCol psBr psBor--dark ps-oh ps-rel\">\n\n                    <div class=\"fiftyFifty__mediaSlide\" >                  \n                                            \n                        \n                            <div class=\"fiftyFifty__mediaWrap ps-oh\" > \n\n                                \n                                                    \n                                    \n    <div class=\"psLazyLoadFrame\" style=\"\n                --focal-x: 50%;\n        --focal-y: 50%;\n        --focal-x-small: 50%;\n        --focal-y-small: 50%;\n        \"> \n        <div class=\"opacityWrap\" style=\"opacity: 1\">\n                            <picture>\n                    \n                        <source \n                            srcset=\"https://adventurecinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Kew-Gardens-1600-image-760x428.jpg\" \n                            media=\"(max-width: 1023px)\">\n                        \n                        <source \n                            srcset=\"https://adventurecinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Kew-Gardens-1600-image.jpg\" \n                            media=\"(min-width: 1024px)\">\n\n                                        <img \n                        src=\"data:image/svg+xml&#44;%3Csvg xmlns='https://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 1600 900'%3E%3C/svg%3E\"\n                        alt=\"\"\n                        class=\"JS--lazyLoad psFitCover\"\n                                                loading=\"lazy\"\n                    />\n                </picture>\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n\n      \n\n                                                  \n                                            \n                            </div>     \n                        \n                                             \n\n                    </div> \n\n                                        \n                </div>    \n\n                <div class=\"fiftyFifty__textCol ps-oh psBr psBor--dark psBg--light psColor--dark psPd-base psPd-6--large\">\n\n                    <div class=\"fiftyFifty__textWrap\">\n\n                        \n                            <span class=\"psTag psTag--yellow psMb-3\">Accessibility</span>\n                            \n                                                                                                                        \n                        <h3 class=\"ps-h-2 psMb-0\">Accessibility at Kew Gardens</h3>                                        \n                        \n                        \n                            <div class=\"psMt-4 ps-h ps-h-5\"><p>The event is held on flat ground with short grass and has accessible toilet facilities on-site. Please speak to our friendly stewards if you require any assistance. Please note that there is no parking available and no fixed drop-off point on-site.</p>\n<p>We offer WatchWord smart glasses that display subtitles for Deaf and hard of hearing guests. Availability is limited and glasses are allocated on a first-come, first-served basis. To reserve a pair, please email <a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#9af2fff6eadafbfeecfff4eeefe8fff9f3f4fff7fbb4f9f5b4eff1a5e9eff8f0fff9eea7cdfbeef9f2cdf5e8febac9f7fbe8eebaddf6fbe9e9ffe9\"><span class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"79111c150939181d0f1c170d0c0b1c1a10171c1418571a16570c12\">[email&#160;protected]</span></a> in advance of the event.</p>\n</div>\n\n                                                \n                        \n                           \n\n                    </div>                \n\n                </div>                                       \n\n            </div>    \n\n        </div>    \n\n    </section>\n\n\n    \n    \n            \n        <section         \n            class=\"flexiLayout quoteCarousel  psTheme--transparent ps-rel ps-z-1\"\n            data-flexi-layout\n            data-quote-carousel-layout\n        >\n\n            <div class=\"quoteCarousel__inner ps-rel\">         \n\n                <div class=\"quoteCarousel__slider\" data-quote-carousel-slider>\n                \n                    \n                                                        \n                        <article class=\"quoteCarousel__slide psFont--center psPb-2\" data-quote-carousel-slide>                            \n\n                            <div class=\"quoteCarousel__slideInner ps-rel psFullWidth\">\n\n                                \n                                    <div class=\"quoteCarousel__imageWrap quoteCarousel__imageWrap--left ps-rel\">\n                                        \n                                        \n                                            <div class=\"ps-abs psBgShape quoteCarousel__bgShape quoteCarousel__bgShape--left\">\n\n                                                <svg width=\"755\" height=\"736\" viewBox=\"0 0 755 736\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                   <path fill=\"var(--pink-lt)\" d=\"M668.234 293.205C643.584 185.095 603.494 9.30517 525.304 0.365174C467.604 -6.22483 381.114 77.1752 336.814 186.015C243.244 123.445 125.784 106.635 78.9738 149.515C20.5738 202.995 73.3038 348.255 114.714 462.295C152.554 566.525 214.084 736.005 292.774 735.195C344.444 734.665 409.924 660.605 445.224 564.355C525.194 619.975 619.414 640.365 664.994 607.995C729.564 562.145 695.204 411.485 668.234 293.195V293.205Z\" />\n               </svg>\n                                            </div>\n\n                                                                                \n                                        <div class=\"quoteCarousel__imageInner psBr psBor--large--light ps-oh\">                                            \n\n                                            \n    <div class=\"psLazyLoadFrame\" style=\"\n                --focal-x: 50%;\n        --focal-y: 50%;\n        --focal-x-small: 50%;\n        --focal-y-small: 50%;\n        \"> \n        <div class=\"opacityWrap\" style=\"opacity: 1\">\n                            <picture>\n                    \n                        <source \n                            srcset=\"https://adventurecinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/250620-owenbphoto-AdventureCinema-Kew-Wicked-146-1-760x507.jpg\" \n                            media=\"(max-width: 1023px)\">\n                        \n                        <source \n                            srcset=\"https://adventurecinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/250620-owenbphoto-AdventureCinema-Kew-Wicked-146-1-1199x800.jpg\" \n                            media=\"(min-width: 1024px)\">\n\n                                        <img \n                        src=\"data:image/svg+xml&#44;%3Csvg xmlns='https://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 1199 800'%3E%3C/svg%3E\"\n                        alt=\"\"\n                        class=\"JS--lazyLoad psFitCover\"\n                                                loading=\"lazy\"\n                    />\n                </picture>\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n\n      \n\n                                        </div>\n\n                                    </div>\n\n                                \n                                <div class=\"quoteCarousel__textWrap ps-rel ps-z-1\">                                                    \n\n                                    \n                                        <h4 class=\"quoteCarousel__heading psMb-0\">What People Are Saying</h4>\n\n                                    \n                                    \n                                        <blockquote class=\"ps-rel pz-z-1 psPl-0 psMb-0 psBor--none\">\n\n                                            <p class=\"ps-h ps-h-5 psPt-4\">\"Mamma Mia, picnics, chocolate covered strawbs &amp; dancing all evening long.. what more could you want !!! ✨🪩 Our first time with Adventure Cinema did not disappoint !! We went to the ExtrABBAganza at such a stunning location📍\"</p>\n\n                                                                                            <cite class=\"psTag psTag--yellow psMt-3\">Jess &amp; Josh</cite>\n                                            \n                                        </blockquote>\n\n                                    \n                                </div>\n\n                                \n                                    <div class=\"quoteCarousel__imageWrap quoteCarousel__imageWrap--right ps-rel\">\n\n                                        \n                                            <div class=\"ps-abs psBgShape quoteCarousel__bgShape quoteCarousel__bgShape--right\">\n\n                                                <svg width=\"590\" height=\"611\" viewBox=\"0 0 590 611\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                   <path fill=\"var(--yellow-lt)\" d=\"M303.436 92.509C303.436 92.509 372.476 -37.031 457.976 10.469C543.826 58.169 520.936 132.569 457.976 180.269C457.976 180.269 587.716 161.189 589.616 300.469C591.526 439.749 465.606 428.299 465.606 428.299C465.606 428.299 553.406 520.649 477.056 580.929C404.556 638.169 326.336 586.649 299.626 510.339C299.626 510.339 234.756 661.059 108.836 592.379C-10.2844 527.409 106.926 399.679 106.926 399.679C106.926 399.679 -17.0842 411.129 1.99576 294.749C21.0758 178.369 146.996 226.069 146.996 226.069C146.996 226.069 32.5257 123.039 158.446 48.639C253.386 -7.46099 303.446 92.519 303.446 92.519L303.436 92.509Z\" />\n               </svg>\n                                            </div>\n\n                                                                                \n                                        <div class=\"quoteCarousel__imageInner psBor--large--light psBr ps-oh\">                                            \n\n                                            \n    <div class=\"psLazyLoadFrame\" style=\"\n                --focal-x: 50%;\n        --focal-y: 50%;\n        --focal-x-small: 50%;\n        --focal-y-small: 50%;\n        \"> \n        <div class=\"opacityWrap\" style=\"opacity: 1\">\n                            <picture>\n                    \n                        <source \n                            srcset=\"https://adventurecinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/what-to-expect-banner-760x507.jpg\" \n                            media=\"(max-width: 1023px)\">\n                        \n                        <source \n                            srcset=\"https://adventurecinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/what-to-expect-banner-1199x800.jpg\" \n                            media=\"(min-width: 1024px)\">\n\n                                        <img \n                        src=\"data:image/svg+xml&#44;%3Csvg xmlns='https://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 1199 800'%3E%3C/svg%3E\"\n                        alt=\"\"\n                        class=\"JS--lazyLoad psFitCover\"\n                                                loading=\"lazy\"\n                    />\n                </picture>\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n\n      \n\n                                        </div>\n\n                                    </div>\n\n                                                                \n\n                            </div>\n\n                        </article>                                                \n\n                    \n                                                        \n                        <article class=\"quoteCarousel__slide psFont--center psPb-2\" data-quote-carousel-slide>                            \n\n                            <div class=\"quoteCarousel__slideInner ps-rel psFullWidth\">\n\n                                \n                                    <div class=\"quoteCarousel__imageWrap quoteCarousel__imageWrap--left ps-rel\">\n                                        \n                                        \n                                            <div class=\"ps-abs psBgShape quoteCarousel__bgShape quoteCarousel__bgShape--left\">\n\n                                                <svg width=\"750\" height=\"540\" viewBox=\"0 0 750 540\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                   <path fill=\"var(--orange-lt)\" d=\"M86.3923 385.672C86.3923 385.672 15.1823 387.492 2.41234 336.372C-14.2477 269.692 60.8425 243.262 60.8425 243.262C60.8425 243.262 29.8126 179.352 104.673 122.762C160.703 80.4021 212.403 111.812 212.403 111.812C212.403 111.812 223.362 26.0021 300.052 13.2221C376.742 0.452082 404.122 57.0521 404.122 57.0521C404.122 57.0521 464.382 -25.1079 548.372 7.76208C632.362 40.6321 603.133 137.402 603.133 137.402C603.133 137.402 688.953 122.802 734.593 190.362C780.233 257.922 703.542 323.642 703.542 323.642C703.542 323.642 780.222 367.472 732.742 435.022C685.142 502.752 608.582 444.142 608.582 444.142C608.582 444.142 592.142 557.342 462.512 537.252C332.882 517.152 352.972 394.832 352.972 394.832C352.972 394.832 289.052 553.672 175.852 531.752C75.3223 512.282 86.4026 385.682 86.4026 385.682L86.3923 385.672Z\" />\n               </svg>\n                                            </div>\n\n                                                                                \n                                        <div class=\"quoteCarousel__imageInner psBr psBor--large--light ps-oh\">                                            \n\n                                            \n    <div class=\"psLazyLoadFrame\" style=\"\n                --focal-x: 50%;\n        --focal-y: 50%;\n        --focal-x-small: 50%;\n        --focal-y-small: 50%;\n        \"> \n        <div class=\"opacityWrap\" style=\"opacity: 1\">\n                            <picture>\n                    \n                        <source \n                            srcset=\"https://adventurecinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/mamma-mia-quote-image-760x760.png\" \n                            media=\"(max-width: 1023px)\">\n                        \n                        <source \n                            srcset=\"https://adventurecinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/mamma-mia-quote-image.png\" \n                            media=\"(min-width: 1024px)\">\n\n                                        <img \n                        src=\"data:image/svg+xml&#44;%3Csvg xmlns='https://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 800 800'%3E%3C/svg%3E\"\n                        alt=\"\"\n                        class=\"JS--lazyLoad psFitCover\"\n                                                loading=\"lazy\"\n                    />\n                </picture>\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n\n      \n\n                                        </div>\n\n                                    </div>\n\n                                \n                                <div class=\"quoteCarousel__textWrap ps-rel ps-z-1\">                                                    \n\n                                    \n                                        <h4 class=\"quoteCarousel__heading psMb-0\">What People Are Saying</h4>\n\n                                    \n                                    \n                                        <blockquote class=\"ps-rel pz-z-1 psPl-0 psMb-0 psBor--none\">\n\n                                            <p class=\"ps-h ps-h-5 psPt-4\">\"We had such a good night watching the Mamma Mia films at Chatelherault. We took our own picnics and enjoyed watching the films in the beautiful sunshine. We sang and danced to our favourite ABBA songs. Had a great time in the best company!\"</p>\n\n                                                                                            <cite class=\"psTag psTag--yellow psMt-3\">K.Miller</cite>\n                                            \n                                        </blockquote>\n\n                                    \n                                </div>\n\n                                \n                                    <div class=\"quoteCarousel__imageWrap quoteCarousel__imageWrap--right ps-rel\">\n\n                                        \n                                            <div class=\"ps-abs psBgShape quoteCarousel__bgShape quoteCarousel__bgShape--right\">\n\n                                                <svg width=\"663\" height=\"685\" viewBox=\"0 0 663 685\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                   <path fill=\"var(--blue-dk)\" d=\"M276.767 139.89C224.587 154.63 179.247 52.76 114.877 67.94C84.8671 75.02 64.5472 104.28 56.9172 125.9C44.6672 160.63 61.9874 184.71 74.9074 233.82C87.0274 279.91 112.057 375.05 70.9074 439.67C49.7474 472.91 9.0472 501.25 0.957202 549.59C-0.0127983 555.36 -0.592798 561.93 0.957202 569.58C8.0072 604.21 51.0974 621.56 70.9074 629.54C89.0674 636.85 163.307 666.75 232.797 629.54C290.297 598.75 313.198 538.78 332.728 487.64C333.318 486.1 334.597 472.53 342.717 457.66C346.817 450.16 353.537 437.84 360.707 437.67C371.907 437.42 381.378 466.95 390.688 500.63C419.798 605.97 419.068 649.74 452.648 671.51C466.648 680.59 482.507 683.18 484.627 683.5C512.047 687.73 534.167 676.7 544.587 671.51C581.007 653.35 635.877 596.75 654.507 511.62C668.717 446.69 669.327 331.06 608.537 293.77C579.987 276.25 547.757 282.08 500.617 245.8C483.277 232.46 471.687 223.27 468.637 207.83C462.407 176.29 500.268 161.57 510.608 113.9C511.678 108.96 521.277 61.53 494.617 29.96C466.717 -3.07005 407.877 -8.36005 368.707 11.97C306.297 44.37 322.268 127.03 276.778 139.88L276.767 139.89Z\" />\n               </svg>\n                                            </div>\n\n                                                                                \n                                        <div class=\"quoteCarousel__imageInner psBor--large--light psBr ps-oh\">                                            \n\n                                            \n    <div class=\"psLazyLoadFrame\" style=\"\n                --focal-x: 50%;\n        --focal-y: 50%;\n        --focal-x-small: 50%;\n        --focal-y-small: 50%;\n        \"> \n        <div class=\"opacityWrap\" style=\"opacity: 1\">\n                            <picture>\n                    \n                        <source \n                            srcset=\"https://adventurecinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/mamma-mia-quote-image-1-760x760.png\" \n                            media=\"(max-width: 1023px)\">\n                        \n                        <source \n                            srcset=\"https://adventurecinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/mamma-mia-quote-image-1.png\" \n                            media=\"(min-width: 1024px)\">\n\n                                        <img \n                        src=\"data:image/svg+xml&#44;%3Csvg xmlns='https://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 800 800'%3E%3C/svg%3E\"\n                        alt=\"\"\n                        class=\"JS--lazyLoad psFitCover\"\n                                                loading=\"lazy\"\n                    />\n                </picture>\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n\n      \n\n                                        </div>\n\n                                    </div>\n\n                                                                \n\n                            </div>\n\n                        </article>                                                \n\n                    \n                                                        \n                        <article class=\"quoteCarousel__slide psFont--center psPb-2\" data-quote-carousel-slide>                            \n\n                            <div class=\"quoteCarousel__slideInner ps-rel psFullWidth\">\n\n                                \n                                <div class=\"quoteCarousel__textWrap ps-rel ps-z-1\">                                                    \n\n                                    \n                                        <h4 class=\"quoteCarousel__heading psMb-0\">What People Are Saying</h4>\n\n                                    \n                                    \n                                        <blockquote class=\"ps-rel pz-z-1 psPl-0 psMb-0 psBor--none\">\n\n                                            <p class=\"ps-h ps-h-5 psPt-4\">\"This is the highlight of my summer, we have now been twice last year for Elvis and we just went to Mama Mia last night. The staff as excellent that greet us and we feel so safe in a big environment. It’s honestly the best experience you can get for your money and I look forward to it every year now.\"</p>\n\n                                                                                            <cite class=\"psTag psTag--yellow psMt-3\">F.Greenhough</cite>\n                                            \n                                        </blockquote>\n\n                                    \n                                </div>\n\n                                \n                                    <div class=\"quoteCarousel__imageWrap quoteCarousel__imageWrap--right ps-rel\">\n\n                                        \n                                            <div class=\"ps-abs psBgShape quoteCarousel__bgShape quoteCarousel__bgShape--right\">\n\n                                                <svg width=\"441\" height=\"615\" viewBox=\"0 0 441 615\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                   <path fill=\"var(--pink-dk)\" d=\"M0.103433 260.559C2.51343 155.929 85.5833 13.359 176.423 1.03897C277.403 -12.661 380.293 111.599 414.043 227.809C447.793 344.019 442.893 409.419 434.163 469.749C417.183 587.149 222.733 693.549 83.2133 531.519C28.8433 468.379 -2.02657 353.229 0.103433 260.559Z\" />\n               </svg>\n                                            </div>\n\n                                                                                \n                                        <div class=\"quoteCarousel__imageInner psBor--la