                      \n                                        <h4 class=\"quoteCarousel__heading psMb-0\">What People Are Saying</h4>\n\n                                    \n                                    \n                                        <blockquote class=\"ps-rel pz-z-1 psPl-0 psMb-0 psBor--none\">\n\n                                            <p class=\"ps-h ps-h-5 psPt-4\">\"Enjoyed Mama Mia at Calke Abbey! It was amazing, love the atmosphere!😍 Definitely will book another cinema adventure 😻\"</p>\n\n                                                                                            <cite class=\"psTag psTag--yellow psMt-3\">Y.Khripunova</cite>\n                                            \n                                        </blockquote>\n\n                                    \n                                </div>\n\n                                \n                                    <div class=\"quoteCarousel__imageWrap quoteCarousel__imageWrap--right ps-rel\">\n\n                                        \n                                            <div class=\"ps-abs psBgShape quoteCarousel__bgShape quoteCarousel__bgShape--right\">\n\n                                                <svg width=\"756\" height=\"623\" viewBox=\"0 0 756 623\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                    <path fill=\"var(--green-dk)\" d=\"M684.544 411.822C722.304 407.212 749.044 372.712 744.594 334.932C739.714 293.512 726.804 242.372 695.784 191.482C602.604 38.6022 427.004 20.7923 398.674 18.4223C266.194 7.35226 69.5144 59.5723 21.4344 209.292C-19.2756 336.082 71.2244 456.072 86.4244 476.212C134.164 539.502 234.514 626.362 324.664 603.362C370.734 591.612 385.484 558.482 426.094 520.062C472.544 476.122 549.594 428.312 684.534 411.822H684.544Z\" />\n               </svg>\n                                            </div>\n\n                                                                                \n                